and that's true.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.199
We know that that's that's an absolutely true
thing.

00:00:57.199 --> 00:01:04.199
The moon is slowly drifting away from Earth
at something like a three point eight centimeters

00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:06.100
per year.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:12.710
And that's something we've seen over the last,
you know, couple few billion years or so.

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:20.571
And Louie's idea is maybe the forest management
and Bureau of Land Management Agencies, they

00:01:20.571 --> 00:01:22.729
