orbit around the sun.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:58.590
We know there's been significant solar flare
activity.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:07.009
And so is there anything that the National
Forest Service or BLM can do to change the

00:02:07.009 --> 00:02:11.910
